<?xml version="1.0"?><quiz type="textAnswer" id="1103" lang="E" hascredits="1"><question><text>&lt;html&gt;What desert rattlesnake moves using a looping, sideways motion?
&lt;/html&gt;</text><image w="153" h="136">T027976A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B823B4B</imagerefid><audio/><audiorefid/></question><answers><answer>sidewinder</answer><answer>sidewinder snake</answer></answers><reward><text>&lt;html&gt;The sidewinder moves by throwing its body sideways in S-shaped loops, leaving a distinctive track in the sand.
&lt;/html&gt;</text><image w="153" h="136">T027976A.jpg</image><imagerefid>1B823B4B</imagerefid><audio/><audiorefid/></reward><credits>&lt;b&gt;Tony Stone Images/Paul Chesley</credits><rewardcredits>Tony Stone Images/Paul Chesley</rewardcredits></quiz>